  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Second prerelease. New: the ADL engine for the Apple II Hi-Res Adventures (Daventry.Adl, with ScummVM's NTSC colour); SCI3 (Leisure Suit Larry 7, Lighthouse, RAMA, Phantasmagoria 2); the VMD and Duck video players; Phantasmagoria; General MIDI through a SoundFont and an MT-32 emulator (a port of Munt); games' own files through kFileIO; Troll's Tale; true-colour output in the hosts (ITrueColorGraphicsDriver); one shared save folder. Some public signatures gained optional parameters (PngWriter, HeadlessGraphics.EncodePng), so code built against 0.1.0-alpha needs recompiling.",
